      "name": "Sukanneya Thiyagarajah",
      "role": "Undergraduate at Queen Mary University of London",
      "description": "I’m a biology student at Queen Mary, focusing on understanding the natural world and the organisms within it. I’m particularly interested in climate change and how different species respond to environmental shifts. In my project, I study general patterns of rarity in species that are used by people, looking broadly at how common or uncommon these species tend to be.",
